    "title": "'90s TV Shows That Totally Changed the World as We Know It - NewsBreak",
    "text": "‘90s TV Shows That Totally Changed the World as We Know It\nBy Iris Lopez,\n40 minutes agoEveryone loves to talk about the “Golden Age of TV” starting in the 2000s, but let’s be real, the ‘90s walked so prestige TV could run. Personally, the ‘90s TV show that will always hold a special place in my heart is Full House. Me and my siblings always made sure to be sitting by the TV on Friday nights to catch new episodes! All the characters were my favorite and made the show that much more relatable!",
